      "text": "Read off the running console at stg-ninjasre, dark theme, at 2498x1208 and 1280x773.\n\nF01 and F02 are one fix, and that fix is upstream of F06, F11, F12 and F17. Start there.\n\nThe other two pages are the proposal: what The agent becomes, and the six rules that carry the rest — plus the six findings those rules do not reach."
